# Factory + poteto-mode

Assigned work (Linear, cloud agent, @Cursor, `/factory`, `/poteto-mode`)
enters the software factory. Do not treat it as a freeform chat.

1. Read `AGENTS.md` and `.cursor/skills/factory/SKILL.md`.
2. Claim or append `factory/queue.md` before editing product code.
   Include the Linear id when the prompt has one.
3. Write a checkable `done when`. Then read pstack `poteto-mode` and
   follow it. Use `subagent_type: "poteto-agent"` for playbook delegates.
4. This app's queue, invariants, and `/verify-<app>` still govern.

Visual design polish is out of scope unless the user asked for it.
Then use Hallmark. Do not vendor Hallmark into Atelier.
